                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  50.586594548271954,
                      "end":  56.7931185095011,
                      "interval":  16,
                      "en":  "Um I had something maybe, about a year ago, but it only lasted a couple of days, it wasn\u0027t anything as long as this.",
