                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  85.7254283399979,
                      "end":  91.7991987439649,
                      "interval":  24,
                      "en":  "OK. So you\u0027ve had ringing, difficulty hearing in your left ear, and feeling slightly sick.",
