                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  91.7991987439649,
                      "end":  97.0224074444679,
                      "interval":  25,
                      "en":  "Um, that\u0027s been, on and off for the six weeks, or is it continuous there throughout that six weeks?",
                      "id":  "025"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  92.023963164289441,
                      "end":  92.805524168456259,
                      "interval":  26,
                      "en":  "Yeah.",
                      "id":  "026"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  97.234369858734851,
                      "end":  104.85514706559914,
                      "interval":  28,
                      "en":  "Uh it\u0027s kind of on and off. Like some things trigger it as well. So, for example, if I\u0027m watching TV or listen to music or something that\u0027ll \u003cUNSURE\u003esolve\u003c/UNSURE\u003e the ringing in the ear.",
