                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  134.752912592013,
                      "end":  143.765846773688,
                      "interval":  35,
                      "en":  "No, OK. Well, you\u0027re right, you should, you shouldn\u0027t be doing that. \u003cUNIN/\u003e Doesn\u0027t clean up wax, it pushes it back in. Alright, um, the first thing that we need to do is we need to get someone to have a look inside your ear.",
