                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  143.765846773688,
                      "end":  152.630621925809,
                      "interval":  36,
                      "en":  "\u0027K. I\u0027m just exclude the simple things. Simple things \u003cUNIN/\u003e might be wax. You know. Someone might have impacted wax, blocking the tube going into the eardrum, which can",
