                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  152.630621925809,
                      "end":  160.606442900611,
                      "interval":  37,
                      "en":  "lead to muffled hearing. Um, if that\u0027s the case, that that\u0027s something that\u0027s easy fixable. But, um, so we need to exclude that first.",
