                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  160.606442900611,
                      "end":  167.841468727646,
                      "interval":  38,
                      "en":  "and then after that, we can consider other potential possibilities. Um, and for that we need to have a look inside the ear drum.",
