                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  175.953102146205,
                      "end":  182.817730399356,
                      "interval":  40,
                      "en":  "It can be done within the next four, five days or so, OK? And then, um, what I\u0027ll do, I\u0027ll send a message to our admin team.",
