                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  182.817730399356,
                      "end":  190.91303634661469,
                      "interval":  41,
                      "en":  "I\u0027ll ask them to slot you into the clinic, one of our clinics in that time frame. You can come in and one of the GPs will just have a quick look in the ear and figure out",
