                      "en":  "OK, fine, alright. Um, so \u003cUNIN/\u003e let\u0027s get your ear checked out. I think that will be the, the most sensible thing to do. And then after that, we can, we\u0027ll be a step closer to figuring out which way we \u003cUNIN/\u003e",
