                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  271.88603767629041,
                      "end":  279.53599961973981,
                      "interval":  58,
                      "en":  "paste the link for a leaflet about Tinnitus, um, in the notes for this appointment. I\u0027d really appreciate it if you could start reading about it.",
